remotecompanion (3.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Web UI: Desktop-style automation hub with iOS-inspired design
  * Automations API: Fast remote control system with HTTP GET/POST requests
  * Scheduled Triggers: Execute action sequences at specific times and days
  * Notification Triggers: Trigger actions from incoming app notifications
  * Flashlight Intensity Control: rc flashlight command now supports values from 1 to 100
  * Improved stability and performance

